@inject Portfolio.Web.Content.IPortfolioContent Content
@*
    Sticky site header: the "RS" monogram (a link back to the top, so it is the Home link), in-page
    anchor navigation and the theme toggle. The bar shows his initials rather than his name, which the
    hero already shows as the page heading (a name in the bar and again in the hero looked redundant,
    2026-11-14). The visible letters are the start of the link's accessible name, so a voice-control
    user can say "click RS" (ADR-0010).

    Anchor links: on the home page they are pure in-page anchors ("#projects"), so tapping one only
    scrolls and works even when the page was opened with a query string, such as the tracking
    parameters email tools add to links. A link starting with "/#" would drop that query string and
    reload the whole page. On the not-found page the sections are not present, so the links go to
    the home page ("/#projects") instead.

    The toggle is rendered hidden and revealed by theme.js, so it never shows as a dead button
    when scripting is unavailable.
*@
@{
    var onHomePage = string.Equals(ViewContext.RouteData.Values["action"]?.ToString(), "Index", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
    var prefix = onHomePage ? string.Empty : "/";
}
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
        @* The crown is decoration (the link's name is "RS, home"). It is one path drawn with the even-odd rule, so the
           cross inside it is a real hole: the header shows through, as if engraved on the front of the crown. *@
        <a class="brand" href="@(prefix + "#top")" aria-label="RS, home" title="Randolf Segubre, back to the top">
            <svg class="brand-crown" viewBox="0 0 24 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 14.4 1.2 4.6 7 9 12 2.6 17 9l5.8-4.4L22 14.4Zm8.8-7.8h2.4v2h2v2h-2v3h-2.4v-3h-2v-2h2Z" />
                <circle cx="1.2" cy="3.7" r="1.2" />
                <circle cx="12" cy="1.8" r="1.3" />
                <circle cx="22.8" cy="3.7" r="1.2" />
            </svg>
            <span class="brand-mark">RS</span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Primary">
            <ul class="nav-list">
                <li><a href="@(prefix + "#about")">About Me</a></li>
                <li><a href="@(prefix + "#live-sites")">Live sites</a></li>
                <li><a href="@(prefix + "#projects")">Projects</a></li>
                <li><a href="@(prefix + "#experience")">Experience</a></li>
                <li><a href="@(prefix + "#contact")">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <button type="button" id="theme-toggle" class="theme-toggle" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Switch to light theme" hidden>
            <span aria-hidden="true">Light</span>
        </button>
    </div>
</header>
